| `evidence.run_date.max_age_days` | integer | `1` | a whole number of days, 0 or more | `scripts/run_date.py` | Sets how many days before the clock a date found in the `evidence.run_date.env` variable may be, which is how long one gate run may last; an older date, or one later than the clock, is refused with exit 2 and never replaced by the clock. | how old a committed stamp may be: `scripts/jobs/review_docs.py` compares that with the last commit's author date (`%as`) | always |
